sequenceDiagram
  participant Bay as Bay (presence + tag bus)
  participant Tag as Bay tag (ATECC608B)
  participant C as Runtime controller
  participant SE as Secure element
  participant K as Contactor
  participant M as Metering AFE
  Bay->>C: presence detect (insertion event)
  C->>Tag: challenge nonce (32 bytes)
  Tag-->>C: signature over nonce + tag cert
  C->>C: verify tag cert chain + AR match + envelope + window
  C->>SE: append AUTHZ record, update head
  alt authorized and interlocks OK
    C->>K: close (both relays)
    C->>SE: append GATE closed
    loop every metering window (default 1 s)
      M-->>C: Vrms, Irms, P, E per phase
      C->>SE: append METER, check envelope
    end
    C->>SE: CHECKPOINT (signed) every window or K records
  else not authorized
    C->>SE: append GATE withheld (claims 6, 27)
  end
  Note over C,K: Envelope breach, AR expiry, tag mismatch on re-check, door open, or watchdog trip opens the gate and logs ENVELOPE_CUTOFF / TAMPER
